COMMENT     This sequence was created via bulk assembly, and represents a
            fragment of a larger assembly. The original sequence is pET28a
            linearized backbone. The full assembled sequence is pET28a
            linearized backbone_His-GlyRSa It was joined to the previous
            sequence, His-GlyRSa, through Gibson assembly. It was joined to the
            next sequence, His-GlyRSa, through Gibson assembly.
